        "created_at": "2016-03-09T21:58:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hey guys,</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>In the spirit of the AMA (I missed it being at work),has Marvel or DC comics ever approached you guys (GTGames) about making a Marvel Sentinels or DC Sentinels? &nbsp;I personally would much rather play Sentinels style (where you actually play a hero) rather than Legenday (where you manage a team). &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Just curious: it seems like they should be sitting up and taking notice how awesome the Sentinels gameplay is.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; Gooday,</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; Richie</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
