        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-12T16:54:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My understanding is that there is only so much you can do to copyright games.  Bad press, yes, but I believe that it would be easy to create a SotM clone that was immune to legal action.</p>",
